> explain (costs off, verbose) select array[1] || 'x' from ic;
ERROR 22P02 malformed array literal: "x" at 49
DETAIL Array value must start with "{" or dimension information.
> create view icv as select i || 'x' as a, quote_literal(i) as q from ic;
